# Build context is the REPO ROOT. Keep only what the image build needs:
# api/src, api/prisma, web/src, web/public and both package*.json files.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image)
**/node_modules

# Build output (rebuilt inside the image; the SPA is copied via --from)
**/dist
**/build

# Secrets - never copy into an image layer
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Uploaded user files (mounted as a volume at runtime)
**/uploads

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Tests, coverage and local scratch artifacts (not needed to build or run)
**/tests
**/coverage
smoke-pago-id.txt
_tmp_*
*.bak

# VCS / CI / docs / agent tooling / compose (not part of the image)
.git
.gitignore
.github
.atl
.codegraph
docs
*.md
docker-compose.yml
